	(text "garage-console  --  16x switch input carrier for Seeed Studio XIAO ESP32C6"
		(at 15.24 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3.5 3.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "33ca1579-8cdc-42b7-bbf2-c8bd46159148")
	)
	(text "J1..J16: JST XH 2.50mm, board-side B2B-XH-A vertical (top entry).\nEach connector = GND + one dedicated switch input. Momentary or toggle,\neither way the firmware sees the pin pulled low while the contact is closed."
		(at 246.38 220.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.7 1.7)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "939e0761-e13a-4f61-ba28-74d47d971e84")
	)
	(text "PCF8575 (U2) -- I/O EXPANDER\nChosen over the MCP23017 because MCP23017's GPA7/GPB7 are output-only\n(DS20001952D p.11), which leaves only 14 usable inputs for 16 switches.\n\nA2:A1:A0 = GND -> I2C 7-bit address 0x20. Address pins tie straight to a\nrail; the datasheet says they need no pull-ups.\n\nAll 16 ports are used as inputs: write 0xFFFF once, then each pin sources\nIOH = 30..300 uA to VCC and a closed switch shorts it to GND. There are no\ndirection registers on this part -- that write IS the input configuration.\n\nINT (U2.1) is open-drain active-low, so R3 pulls it up. Any port edge\nasserts it; reading the port clears it.\n\nC3..C18 (100nF) filter EMI picked up on the switch cabling and debounce\nthe contact. The release edge is deliberately slow, ~8 ms worst case at\nIOH min -- fine for switches, so no external pull-ups are fitted."
		(at 15.24 241.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.7 1.7)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "35c10f64-0962-461f-a045-1698b29e9686")
	)
	(text "POWER\nFed from the XIAO's own USB-C. +3V3 is the XIAO on-module LDO (U1.12).\nNo battery / charger: unlike the Grove Shield this reference is based on,\nthe board is permanently USB-powered, so that circuitry is dropped.\nNo power LED either -- the XIAO's own LED_BUILTIN covers it."
		(at 15.24 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.7 1.7)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "726596d2-e09c-4192-8b63-650d29a445ef")
	)
